<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακομ-ιδή</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκομιδά</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			4.742.17
		</span></i>, ἡ:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a carrying away again, recovery,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν πλοίων ἀ.</span> Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>recovery,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν νούσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>return,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				597b9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				615.14
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				11.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>bringing up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐπιτηδείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					3.3.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
